abstract: "Nine-stage Python pipeline that turns a curated URL list into a synthesized political platform — scrapes and caches pages, extracts principles, policies, values, and goals with the Claude Agent SDK, then generates essays and Markdown/HTML/JSON platform documents with DALL-E 3 imagery."
